sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant E as Editor
    participant P as Publish API
    participant D as Publication store
    participant W as Notification worker
    participant S as Subscriber
    E->>P: Publish draft (request key)
    P->>D: Look up request key
    alt Request already committed
        D-->>P: Existing publication ID
        P-->>E: Existing publication ID
    else New request
        P->>D: Transaction: publication + request key + outbox event
        D-->>P: Commit confirmed
        P-->>E: Publication ID
    end
    Note over D,W: Outbox delivery is asynchronous
    W->>D: Claim pending event
    D-->>W: Event and stable event ID
    W->>S: Notify (event ID)
    alt Subscriber acknowledges
        S-->>W: Acknowledgement
        W->>D: Mark event delivered
    else Timeout or rejection
        Note over W,D: Keep event pending for retry
        Note over W,S: Subscriber must deduplicate<br/>repeated event IDs
    end
